{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/8882389f19682bf7722ba8669bff2abf.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your fleet of ships and fight against each other to conquer the Battlegeuse solar system. There are 5 fleets for each player to play with, each of these has different properties, sp<strong>eed, energy consumption, etc.. The goal is to destroy the opponent's mothership on each planet of the solar system, conquered all</strong> the planets, the player wins the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/45aaa5f94ad7efeaaae79e6042c3e82f.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy a better spaceship. In Battlegeuse you have many different strategies to get the better of your enemy, having the fastest and most agile ship is one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/0fbea74fc62b268cf6ffcbc721b6c641.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build special buildings to defend your conquered planet. There are 7 different modules, each with unique potential. It is up to you and your strategy to buy the right module.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/710d04f4b0b1f966693fb6ac1b6ec13e.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the map with missiles to open up different paths and create your own winning strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/6efd183cd308e49a9490a1ff99d09dea.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/71157e8096b15e47f4acf1d53142f37a.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable resources for your battle. collect emeralds to add research points, you will need them to buy additional modules and weapons.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653240?t=1766427898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653240?t=1766427898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/101c6eaed7098988e37cad704b0e0e56a6c27ec0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766427898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/101c6eaed7098988e37cad704b0e0e56a6c27ec0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766427898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/8882389f19682bf7722ba8669bff2abf.avif?t=1766427898\" width=800 height=374 />